Victory At Sea Pacific – is a large-scale third-person combat strategy game where you control a Pacific fleet! To win, you must find and destroy all enemy ships. Explore this open world to effectively counter the enemy fleet!

First, you need to create your own campaign. It depends entirely on your preferences. For example, if you've decided to fight exclusively on the water, forget about aircraft. Yes, they can also change the course of the battle, given that the action takes place during World War II, but it's better to focus solely on the navy. You have an entire fleet at your disposal. It can torpedo the enemy, hinting to them that there's no point in sailing the Pacific Ocean without your knowledge. Plan your strategy, destroy ships.

The game mechanics are sandbox-like. The further you progress through the storyline, the more ships you unlock. Each mission begins with you searching for an enemy in the open ocean. It's a game of cat and mouse, to be honest. When you spot an enemy with a scout, you must direct your entire fleet toward them.

To use all possible vehicles you should download Victory At Sea Pacific Free torrent download. These can include warships, heavy aircraft carriers, bombers, and heavy squadrons. You'll also be able to control aircraft carrying paratroopers, who will capture an enemy ship in minutes.

Game features:
- Upgrade your ports and shipyards. Build them on captured territory. Send your ships to the place where you want to settle your world;
- If the enemy ship has gone too far, you can always stop it with bombers or submarines;
- Use the full power of World War II ships and equipment! More than 100 ships, dozens of aircraft;
- Deprive the enemy of tactical resources. Try to leave the enemy without resources;
- Choose who you'll play as. It could be the USSR's allies, or it could be the Axis powers;
- Fight in small battles or full-scale, large-scale battles in Victoria at Sea Pacific!

Installation:
1. Install following the setup instructions.
2. Run the game.
